Server init.
>> a := Blob ùr: 4.
a bytes: ( Liosta ùr ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob ùr: 4.
b bytes: ( Liosta ùr ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a ùr.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Às-chur sgrìobh: ( a ^ c ), loidhne-ùr. } glac: { :e Às-chur sgrìobh: e, loidhne-ùr. }, tòisich.
a saor.
b saor.
